      "writtenOn": "2024-05-02T23:03:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Well stubs will never be installed, so they won\u0027t emit any packaging specs in the first place. So I don\u0027t think they\u0027re a valid reason to keep `installable: false`.",
